{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Use this prompt in **Shopify AI (Impulse Theme)** to generate a section that closely matches the UI in your reference.
    
    ---
    
    # Shopify AI Prompt – Premium Lead Capture / Consultation Section
    
    Create a premium Shopify section named **"Consultation Lead Form"** that matches the attached design as closely as possible. The design should feel modern, high-end, and conversion-focused for a Shopify agency.
    
    ## Layout
    
    * Maximum width: **1480px**
    * Center aligned
    * Two-column layout (45% / 55%)
    * Desktop:
    
      * Left = Information panel
      * Right = Lead capture form
    * Mobile:
    
      * Stack vertically
      * Form appears first
      * Information section below
    
    Section spacing:
    
    * Top padding: 100px
    * Bottom padding: 100px
    * Border radius: 24px
    * Thin gradient border around the entire section
    * Overflow hidden
    
    Background:
    
    * Pure black (#050505)
    * Very subtle radial glow
    * Soft purple and orange ambient lighting
    * Add abstract glowing network/grid pattern in the center background with low opacity (5–8%)
    
    ---
    
    # Color Palette
    
    Background:
    #050505
    
    Card:
    #0B0B0B
    
    Border:
    rgba(255,255,255,.08)
    
    Orange:
    #FF7A00
    
    Purple:
    #7B4DFF
    
    White:
    #FFFFFF
    
    Secondary text:
    #B5B5B5
    
    Input background:
    #141414
    
    Input border:
    rgba(255,255,255,.08)
    
    Hover glow:
    Orange + Purple gradient
    
    ---
    
    # Left Side
    
    Top badge:
    
    Rounded pill
    
    ✨ Free Shopify Consultation
    
    Orange outline
    
    Dark background
    
    14px text
    
    Spacing below: 36px
    
    ---
    
    Heading
    
    Large bold heading
    
    Tell Us About
    Your Project
    
    Highlight only:
    
    Your
    
    using orange gradient.
    
    Font size:
    
    Desktop:
    64px
    
    Mobile:
    42px
    
    Weight:
    800
    
    Line height:
    1.05
    
    ---
    
    Paragraph
    
    Whether you're launching a new Shopify store, migrating from another platform, or looking to improve conversions, our Shopify experts are ready to help.
    
    We'll review your requirements and recommend the best solution for your business.
    
    Width:
    520px
    
    Color:
    #B8B8B8
    
    Line height:
    1.8
    
    ---
    
    Benefits List
    
    Create five feature rows.
    
    Each row has:
    
    Left glowing purple circular icon
    
    Text
    
    Divider line underneath
    
    Items:
    
    • Free Strategy Consultation
    
    • Response within 24 Hours
    
    • Shopify Plus & CRO Experts
    
    • No Obligation Quote
    
    • Trusted by 150+ Ecommerce Brands
    
    Each icon:
    
    44px circle
    
    Purple glow
    
    Dark center
    
    Thin border
    
    Spacing:
    
    24px
    
    ---
    
    Bottom CTA
    
    Large outlined button
    
    Book a Discovery Call →
    
    Height:
    60px
    
    Width:
    340px
    
    Orange border
    
    Transparent background
    
    Hover:
    
    Orange fill
    
    White text
    
    Smooth animation
    
    ---
    
    # Right Side Form
    
    Dark card
    
    Padding:
    40px
    
    Rounded:
    24px
    
    No shadows
    
    Subtle border
    
    ---
    
    Fields
    
    Name *
    
    Email *
    
    Phone Number *
    
    Service Interested In *
    
    Message (Optional)
    
    Each input:
    
    Height:
    60px
    
    Background:
    #141414
    
    Border:
    1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)
    
    Radius:
    10px
    
    White text
    
    Placeholder:
    #8A8A8A
    
    Icon on left
    
    Padding:
    18px
    
    Focus state:
    
    Orange border
    
    Soft glow
    
    ---
    
    Service Dropdown
    
    Options:
    
    Shopify Store Setup
    
    Shopify Migration
    
    Custom Shopify Development
    
    Website Redesign
    
    Website Audit
    
    Pricing Inquiry
    
    Other
    
    Dropdown arrow on right.
    
    ---
    
    Message Field
    
    Height:
    140px
    
    Resizable disabled
    
    Placeholder:
    
    Tell us about your project...
    
    ---
    
    Primary Button
    
    Full width
    
    Height:
    64px
    
    Rounded:
    12px
    
    Gradient:
    
    Purple → Orange
    
    Text:
    
    Get Free Proposal →
    
    White
    
    Bold
    
    Hover:
    
    Slight lift
    
    Gradient becomes brighter
    
    Soft glow
    
    Transition:
    0.3s
    
    ---
    
    Bottom Statistics
    
    Below the form add a horizontal divider.
    
    Then create three equal statistic cards.
    
    Each includes:
    
    Purple glowing icon
    
    Orange number
    
    White title
    
    Cards:
    
    150+
    
    Shopify Projects Completed
    
    98%
    
    Client Satisfaction
    
    Under 24 Hours
    
    Average Response Time
    
    Desktop:
    3 columns
    
    Mobile:
    Stack vertically
    
    ---
    
    # Animations
    
    Fade up on scroll
    
    Buttons lift slightly
    
    Icons glow on hover
    
    Input border animation
    
    Gradient button shimmer
    
    Entire section fades into view
    
    ---
    
    # Shopify Theme Editor Settings
    
    Allow editing:
    
    * Badge text
    * Heading
    * Highlight word
    * Paragraph
    * Benefit list (repeater)
    * Discovery button text/link
    * Form title
    * Service dropdown options
    * CTA button text
    * Statistics (repeater)
    * Background glow intensity
    * Border radius
    * Section padding
    * Enable/Disable background network graphic
    * Gradient colors
    * Custom icons
    * Success message
    * Form destination (Shopify Contact Form)
    
    ---
    
    # Responsive Behavior
    
    Desktop:
    
    * Two-column layout
    * Equal vertical alignment
    * Form remains fixed height
    * Large typography
    
    Tablet:
    
    * Smaller heading
    * Reduced padding
    * Maintain two columns until 992px
    
    Mobile:
    
    * Single column
    * Form appears first
    * Buttons full width
    * Statistics stacked vertically
    * Comfortable spacing between fields
    
    ---
    
    ## Development Notes
    
    * Build as a native Shopify section using Liquid, HTML, CSS, and minimal JavaScript.
    * Use the native Shopify contact form (`{% form 'contact' %}`) for submissions.
    * Ensure all form fields are accessible with proper labels and validation.
    * Optimize for performance with no external libraries.
    * Match the attached reference UI as closely as possible, including spacing, typo
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-consultation-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.outer_background_color }};
  }

  .ai-consultation-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-consultation-background-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .ai-consultation-glow-purple-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 20%;
    left: 10%;
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, {{ block.settings.purple_glow_color }} 0%, transparent 70%);
    opacity: {{ block.settings.glow_intensity }};
    filter: blur(80px);
  }

  .ai-consultation-glow-orange-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20%;
    right: 10%;
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, {{ block.settings.orange_glow_color }} 0%, transparent 70%);
    opacity: {{ block.settings.glow_intensity }};
    filter: blur(80px);
  }

  {% if block.settings.show_network_graphic %}
  .ai-consultation-network-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 80%;
    height: 80%;
    background-image: 
      linear-gradient({{ block.settings.network_line_color }} 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, {{ block.settings.network_line_color }} 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 50px 50px;
    opacity: {{ block.settings.network_opacity }};
  }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-consultation-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 45% 55%;
    gap: 60px;
    padding: 80px 60px;
  }

  .ai-consultation-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 36px;
  }

  .ai-consultation-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.badge_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.badge_border_color }};
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .ai-consultation-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_desktop }}px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-consultation-heading-highlight-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.highlight_gradient }};
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .ai-consultation-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 520px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .ai-consultation-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .ai-consultation-benefit-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid {{ block.settings.divider_color }};
  }

  .ai-consultation-benefit-{{ ai_gen_id }}:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .ai-consultation-benefit-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.icon_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.icon_border }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px {{ block.settings.icon_glow_color }};
  }

  .ai-consultation-benefit-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
  }

  .ai-consultation-benefit-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: {{ block.settings.benefit_text_color }};
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ai-consultation-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    height: 60px;
    width: 340px;
    background-color: transparent;
    border: 2px solid {{ block.settings.cta_border_color }};
    border-radius: 12px;
    color: {{ block.settings.cta_text_color }};
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ai-consultation-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.cta_hover_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.cta_hover_text }};
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .ai-consultation-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ai-consultation-form-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.form_card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.form_card_border }};
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 40px;
  }

  .ai-consultation-form-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .ai-consultation-form-group-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ai-consultation-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.label_color }};
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ai-consultation-input-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-consultation-input-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    left: 18px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    color: {{ block.settings.icon_input_color }};
  }

  .ai-consultation-input-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 60px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.input_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.input_border }};
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 18px 18px 18px 50px;
    color: {{ block.settings.input_text_color }};
    font-size: 15px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-consultation-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}::placeholder {
    color: {{ block.settings.placeholder_color }};
  }

  .ai-consultation-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: {{ block.settings.input_focus_border }};
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px {{ block.settings.input_focus_glow }};
  }

  .ai-consultation-select-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 60px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.input_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.input_border }};
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 18px 50px 18px 50px;
    color: {{ block.settings.input_text_color }};
    font-size: 15px;
    appearance: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-consultation-select-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: {{ block.settings.input_focus_border }};
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px {{ block.settings.input_focus_glow }};
  }

  .ai-consultation-select-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    right: 18px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    color: {{ block.settings.icon_input_color }};
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .ai-consultation-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 140px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.input_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.input_border }};
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 18px 18px 18px 50px;
    color: {{ block.settings.input_text_color }};
    font-size: 15px;
    resize: none;
    font-family: inherit;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-consultation-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }}::placeholder {
    color: {{ block.settings.placeholder_color }};
  }

  .ai-consultation-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: {{ block.settings.input_focus_border }};
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px {{ block.settings.input_focus_glow }};
  }

  .ai-consultation-submit-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 64px;
    background: {{ block.settings.submit_gradient }};
    border: none;
    border-radius: 12px;
    color: {{ block.settings.submit_text_color }};
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ai-consultation-submit-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px {{ block.settings.submit_glow }};
    filter: brightness(1.1);
  }

  .ai-consultation-stats-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding-top: 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid {{ block.settings.divider_color }};
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .ai-consultation-stat-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-consultation-stat-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    margin: 0 auto 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: {{ block.settings.stat_icon_color }};
  }

  .ai-consultation-stat-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px {{ block.settings.stat_icon_glow }});
  }

  .ai-consultation-stat-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: {{ block.settings.stat_number_color }};
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .ai-consultation-stat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.stat_label_color }};
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-consultation-success-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 16px;
    background-color: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.3);
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: #22c55e;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .ai-consultation-error-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 16px;
    background-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: #ef4444;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 992px) {
    .ai-consultation-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
      padding: 60px 40px;
    }

    .ai-consultation-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-consultation-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .ai-consultation-stats-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-consultation-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top | times: 0.6 }}px 16px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom | times: 0.6 }}px;
    }

    .ai-consultation-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 40px 24px;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      grid-template-rows: auto auto;
    }

    .ai-consultation-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      order: -1;
    }

    .ai-consultation-form-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 30px 24px;
    }

    .ai-consultation-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<consultation-form-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-consultation-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-consultation-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-consultation-background-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-consultation-glow-purple-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
      <div class="ai-consultation-glow-orange-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
      {% if block.settings.show_network_graphic %}
        <div class="ai-consultation-network-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-consultation-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-consultation-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.badge_text != blank %}
          <div class="ai-consultation-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <span>✨</span>
            <span>{{ block.settings.badge_text }}</span>
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-consultation-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.heading_before_highlight }}
            {% if block.settings.heading_highlight != blank %}
              <span class="ai-consultation-heading-highlight-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading_highlight }}</span>
            {% endif %}
            {{ block.settings.heading_after_highlight }}
          </h2>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
          <div class="ai-consultation-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.description }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.show_benefits %}
          <div class="ai-consultation-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.benefit_1 != blank %}
              <div class="ai-consultation-benefit-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-consultation-benefit-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="ai-consultation-benefit-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.benefit_1 }}</span>
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.benefit_2 != blank %}
              <div class="ai-consultation-benefit-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-consultation-benefit-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="ai-consultation-benefit-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.benefit_2 }}</span>
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.benefit_3 != blank %}
              <div class="ai-consultation-benefit-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-consultation-benefit-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="ai-consultation-benefit-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.benefit_3 }}</span>
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.benefit_4 != blank %}
              <div class="ai-consultation-benefit-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-consultation-benefit-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />
